      "answer": "**Root cause:** In `Balance()` (ledger.go:49), the condition was inverted — it used `!=` instead of `==`, so it was summing entries for *all accounts except* the one queried. The extra `e.Currency == \"\"` check was also spurious.\n\n**Fix:** Changed `e.AccountID != accountID || e.Currency == \"\"` to `e.AccountID == accountID`, matching the SQL comment above the method.",
      "agent_patch": "diff --git a/internal/ledger/ledger.go b/internal/ledger/ledger.go\nindex 5f31c1d..690c3c5 100644\n--- a/internal/ledger/ledger.go\n+++ b/internal/ledger/ledger.go\n@@ -46,7 +46,7 @@ func (l *Ledger) Balance(accountID string) int64 {\n \tdefer l.mu.Unlock()\n \tvar b int64\n \tfor _, e := range l.entries {\n-\t\tif e.AccountID != accountID || e.Currency == \"\" {\n+\t\tif e.AccountID == accountID {\n \t\t\tb += e.AmountCents\n \t\t}\n \t}\n",
